OL,3,ATrump hits Canada with import ban on
OL,4,Aalcohol and other goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney has said
OL,7,Fthat Canada's pivot away from the US as
OL,8,Fits largest trading partner "will come
OL,9,Fat a cost", as a wave of Canadian
OL,10,Fretaliatory tariffs on American goods
OL,11,Fcome into force.
OL,13,FIn a video address, Carney added that
OL,14,Fthe counter-tariffs against the US "are
OL,15,Fnecessary to protect our workers".
OL,17,FCanada's levies will apply to nearly
OL,18,FC$28bn ($20bn; #15bn) of American
OL,19,Fproducts, from steel to furniture to
OL,20,Fcotton T-shirts, and will be as high as
OL,21,F50%.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
