OL,3,ATrump hits Canada with import ban on
OL,4,Aalcohol and other goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth US and Canadian officials have
OL,7,Fsaid they would like to strike a deal,
OL,8,Fbut no new talks have been scheduled
OL,9,Fsince negotiations collapsed in late
OL,10,FAugust.
